    "detailed_description": "\u3010Game Overview\u3011<br />\r\nHide And Seek is a first-person survival horror game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJinju, who was playing hide and seek with her friend, falls asleep in the closet.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen I woke up and came out of the closet, I found blood in the bathtub in the basement.<br />\r\nThe familiar house was engulfed in darkness and looked completely different from usual.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAim to escape from the strange house!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Game Points\u3011<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a1 Randomly generated stages<br />\r\nThe strange house changes form each time you play.<br />\r\nThe location of the item changes every time, so let's respond appropriately to the situation and try to escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a1 Chasers with different characteristics<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe pursuer wandering the house uses sight and hearing to detect and chase the player.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnderstand the characteristics of each pursuer and deal with them well to survive as long as possible.",
